WEBVTT

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:03.837
It seems pretty hard being an
apprentice Season Fairy.

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:08.342
They can't become a full-fledged
Season Fairy without a lot of studying.

00:00:08.342 --> 00:00:12.212
I used to think it was
all just fun and games,

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:15.415
but it looks like
it's hard work, too.

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:18.652
I wonder if she'll
be able to do it...

00:00:18.652 --> 00:00:21.519
I'm really worried.

00:00:23.157 --> 00:00:26.793
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:29.830
On my lips,

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:33.994
The rouge of tears.

00:00:54.288 --> 00:00:57.791
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:57.791 --> 00:01:05.254
I don't want to know
such a thing as love.

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:12.239
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:12.239 --> 00:01:15.375
On my lips,

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:18.833
The rouge of tears.

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:26.987
On Thursdays

00:01:26.987 --> 00:01:29.723
I buy roses and...

00:01:29.723 --> 00:01:34.023
add a letter.

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:41.235
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:41.235 --> 00:01:44.238
When I see you
in my dreams,

00:01:44.238 --> 00:01:48.504
you're so caring.

00:02:01.722 --> 00:02:05.425
Oh, Saga.
What are you doing at this hour?

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:08.829
Not much. I thought I'd give
my room a good cleaning.

00:02:08.829 --> 00:02:11.855
A good cleaning?
But your room's always so clean.

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:24.973
Ok!

00:02:36.056 --> 00:02:39.514
She's coming home, so I'd
better have everything cleaned up.

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:43.085
Tomorrow's the day, huh?

00:02:44.331 --> 00:02:46.633
I'll be back in a week.

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:50.467
You'll just have to sleep
without me, Saga.

00:02:50.671 --> 00:02:51.763
All right.

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:55.464
Starting tomorrow
it'll be noisy again.

00:02:56.143 --> 00:02:57.474
Good grief...

00:03:04.818 --> 00:03:06.479
That was delicious!

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:09.445
I'm going shopping!

00:03:22.836 --> 00:03:24.235
Welcome!

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:31.278
Hmm. Ok, this and this!
And this and this and this!

00:03:31.278 --> 00:03:32.279
Ok!

00:03:32.279 --> 00:03:34.948
Following is information
on the typhoon.

00:03:34.948 --> 00:03:37.317
The large, powerful
Typhoon 13 touched down

00:03:37.317 --> 00:03:39.152
The large, powerful
Typhoon 13 touched down
Sugar probably wasn't able to
eat any waffles on her trip,

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:41.021
in the Schwargen area
early this morning...
Sugar probably wasn't able to
eat any waffles on her trip,

00:03:41.021 --> 00:03:43.956
in the Schwargen area
early this morning...
so she'll be glad
to see these.

00:03:54.735 --> 00:03:56.203
A typhoon?

00:03:56.203 --> 00:03:58.194
What an amazing job
we've come across!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:02.832
At this rate, it looks like we'll
have to wait for a while.

00:04:03.477 --> 00:04:06.344
Hey, how long do
we have to wait?

00:04:06.546 --> 00:04:09.071
Will we be able to
get back today?

00:04:09.149 --> 00:04:12.915
I don't know. It's up
to that Typhoon Fairy.

00:04:22.963 --> 00:04:24.931
We have to pass through
here to get home,

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:27.491
and it may be a while
before he's finished.

00:04:27.868 --> 00:04:30.029
We might not
make it back today.

00:04:30.237 --> 00:04:32.906
-What?
-N-No way.

00:04:32.906 --> 00:04:35.932
I promised Saga
I'd be home today!

00:04:38.845 --> 00:04:40.380
-Huh? Oh, Sugar!
-Huh? Oh, Sugar!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.813
Typhoon Fairy!

00:04:42.249 --> 00:04:46.481
I just have to get past this
village today! So...

00:04:47.254 --> 00:04:48.551
Please!

00:04:50.924 --> 00:04:52.915
Typhoon Fairy!

00:04:59.166 --> 00:05:00.463
Are you all right?

00:05:01.201 --> 00:05:02.469
Typhoon Fairy!

00:05:02.469 --> 00:05:06.473
Stop it, Sugar!
You'll interfere with his work.

00:05:06.473 --> 00:05:07.462
But...

00:05:07.707 --> 00:05:10.243
He's working on
an important job.

00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:13.110
A typhoon is a very
important part of nature.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:17.484
He has to control the clouds, the wind
and the rain all at once to do that.

00:05:17.484 --> 00:05:21.545
As a Season Fairy, you understand
what a great task that is, don't you, Sugar?

00:05:22.422 --> 00:05:24.117
I understand...

00:05:25.258 --> 00:05:30.096
We'll just have to wait here
until the job is done.

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:31.832
-Ok, Sugar?

00:05:31.832 --> 00:05:32.499
-Ok, Sugar?
-Ok.

00:05:32.499 --> 00:05:34.501
What amazing power, though!

00:05:34.501 --> 00:05:37.070
Yeah, it looks interesting.

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:40.507
Ok, I'm gonna
add some thunder!

00:05:40.507 --> 00:05:41.508
Me, too!

00:05:41.508 --> 00:05:45.274
Hey! Don't you
two wander off!

00:05:48.682 --> 00:05:50.450
There's nothing we can do.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.644
You're right.

00:05:53.253 --> 00:05:56.745
Saga. I wonder what
you're doing now...

00:06:04.464 --> 00:06:05.453
Mr. Henry.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:09.002
Huh? Oh, Saga.

00:06:09.002 --> 00:06:10.470
Hello, Mr. Henry.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.837
You seem even more
energetic than usual today, Saga.

00:06:15.175 --> 00:06:17.477
Are you going on a trip?

00:06:17.477 --> 00:06:20.780
Yeah. I was able to
get three days off,

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:23.977
so I was planning
a little trip, but...

00:06:24.484 --> 00:06:25.785
What happened?

00:06:25.785 --> 00:06:28.088
The trains are stopped.

00:06:28.088 --> 00:06:31.124
I can't get to my destination
because of the typhoon.

00:06:31.124 --> 00:06:32.284
Typhoon?

00:06:32.492 --> 00:06:36.429
Yeah. I heard about it
when I got to the station.

00:06:36.429 --> 00:06:38.488
Very annoying.

00:06:38.632 --> 00:06:40.100
That's too bad.

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:43.968
I know. Shall I make
a new plan for you?

00:06:45.171 --> 00:06:51.444
That's ok, Saga. I'll just
spend some leisurely time at home.

00:06:51.444 --> 00:06:53.446
I have a book I need to
finish reading, anyway.

00:06:53.446 --> 00:06:54.447
Oh, really?

00:06:54.447 --> 00:06:55.849
See you later, Saga.

00:06:55.849 --> 00:06:56.838
Good-bye.

00:06:56.983 --> 00:06:58.685
That darn typhoon.

00:06:58.685 --> 00:07:02.018
Touching down in the
Schwargen area, of all places...

00:07:03.123 --> 00:07:04.852
The Schwargen area!

00:07:08.061 --> 00:07:10.291
Um...
There it is!

00:07:11.464 --> 00:07:17.270
Hmm. This is our town, and this
is where Sugar and the others went.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:19.673
So where is Schwargen?

00:07:19.673 --> 00:07:23.076
I knew it. It's right
in her return path!

00:07:23.076 --> 00:07:26.012
Next, we have the typhoon report
everyone's been waiting to hear...

00:07:26.012 --> 00:07:30.917
And here it is: Typhoon 13 is
moving into the Schwargen region,

00:07:30.917 --> 00:07:33.153
and continues to have winds

00:07:33.153 --> 00:07:37.490
of over 40 meters per second
near the eye of the storm.

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:43.897
We anticipate its continuing for some time.
Area residents have been fully alerted.

00:07:43.897 --> 00:07:44.731
Please take caution...

00:07:44.731 --> 00:07:46.824
Please take caution...
No way!

00:07:48.635 --> 00:07:51.001
I wonder if Sugar
and the rest are ok.

00:07:51.137 --> 00:07:55.938
I bought her waffles, and
now she won't be back today.

00:07:56.977 --> 00:07:59.846
But more importantly,
Sugar's near the typhoon.

00:07:59.846 --> 00:08:02.440
I hope she doesn't get
pulled in or anything.

00:08:03.183 --> 00:08:07.017
Oh, no. That
would never happen!

00:08:07.454 --> 00:08:09.723
Yeah, now that
I think about it,

00:08:09.723 --> 00:08:12.592
there are adult
Season Fairies with them.

00:08:12.592 --> 00:08:14.822
I'm sure they'll
be all right!

00:08:18.865 --> 00:08:22.035
But...
She's so careless.

00:08:22.035 --> 00:08:26.938
No. Will she really
be ok? But, but...

00:08:29.476 --> 00:08:30.465
Saga.

00:08:31.711 --> 00:08:32.700
Mr. Paul.

00:08:33.747 --> 00:08:35.874
Huh? I can play now?

00:08:35.949 --> 00:08:41.012
Yeah. The owner just went out,
and he shouldn't be back for a while.

00:08:41.855 --> 00:08:43.618
The piano, huh?

00:08:53.433 --> 00:08:54.730
Saga. Saga!

00:08:55.168 --> 00:08:57.966
It's amazing how fast
her fingers move.

00:08:58.104 --> 00:09:00.707
You did all that
just now, didn't you!

00:09:00.707 --> 00:09:02.299
I'm amazed!

00:09:08.682 --> 00:09:10.081
What is it, Saga?

00:09:13.553 --> 00:09:14.781
Oh, yeah.

00:09:34.841 --> 00:09:36.276
-I'm home.

00:09:36.276 --> 00:09:38.005
-I'm home.
-Dinner's ready soon.

00:09:38.144 --> 00:09:39.076
Ok.

00:09:44.818 --> 00:09:45.819
Saga?

00:09:45.819 --> 00:09:48.379
Huh? Oh, sorry.

00:09:50.356 --> 00:09:52.483
Mm, this is good.

00:09:59.499 --> 00:10:02.491
I guess she's really
not coming home today.

00:10:03.937 --> 00:10:07.498
Oh! Maybe she'll come back
in the middle of the night.

00:10:12.946 --> 00:10:16.939
There! Now Sugar can
come back anytime.

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:20.210
Come home soon, Sugar.

00:10:29.963 --> 00:10:30.952
Saga.

00:10:31.731 --> 00:10:34.234
Sugar! When did you get back?

00:10:34.234 --> 00:10:36.225
No, I'm not back yet.

00:10:37.036 --> 00:10:40.540
But don't worry.
I'm fine.

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:41.541
Really?

00:10:41.541 --> 00:10:44.410
Yeah!
But more importantly...

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:45.399
What?

00:10:45.545 --> 00:10:47.547
Are you all right, Saga?

00:10:47.547 --> 00:10:51.483
Of course I'm all right!
What are you talking about, Sugar?

00:10:51.785 --> 00:10:52.945
Really?

00:10:52.986 --> 00:10:55.355
Of course, Sugar.

00:10:55.355 --> 00:10:56.652
Sugar?

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.484
Sugar!

00:11:06.266 --> 00:11:07.255
Sugar.

00:11:15.275 --> 00:11:17.971
Huh? A dream?

00:11:18.244 --> 00:11:21.236
What a strange dream. Sugar?

00:11:23.516 --> 00:11:26.508
I guess she's not
home after all.

00:11:38.031 --> 00:11:40.898
Oh, that's right,
I left the window open last night.

00:11:45.905 --> 00:11:47.532
That'll do it.

00:12:03.089 --> 00:12:04.224
-I'm going now!

00:12:04.224 --> 00:12:05.714
-I'm going now!
-See you later.

00:12:10.697 --> 00:12:14.567
Typhoon 13 has touched down and is
still hovering over the Schwargen region.

00:12:14.567 --> 00:12:17.661
The quantity of
rain since it started...

00:12:17.837 --> 00:12:19.498
-Good morning!
-Good morning!

00:12:23.243 --> 00:12:25.812
What's wrong, Saga?
Do you have a cold?

00:12:25.812 --> 00:12:29.515
I went to sleep last night
with the window open, so...

00:12:29.515 --> 00:12:31.506
Why did you do that?

00:12:32.018 --> 00:12:35.818
I forgot to close it.
But it's nothing.

00:12:35.989 --> 00:12:38.524
Really? Are you really ok?

00:12:38.524 --> 00:12:39.513
Yeah!

00:12:42.195 --> 00:12:44.297
I'm fine.

00:12:44.297 --> 00:12:45.423
Really?

00:12:45.732 --> 00:12:49.395
But more importantly,
are you all right, Saga?

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:53.239
I'm all right, too.

00:12:53.239 --> 00:12:54.228
Huh?

00:12:54.607 --> 00:12:58.478
No, it's nothing.
A cold like this doesn't bother me!

00:12:58.478 --> 00:13:01.881
But I can't believe you
slept with the window open.

00:13:01.881 --> 00:13:04.484
It's not like you, Saga.
You're usually so conscientious.

00:13:04.484 --> 00:13:06.748
Well...

00:13:15.895 --> 00:13:19.032
Anyway, you should
take it easy today.

00:13:19.032 --> 00:13:20.033
Yeah.

00:13:20.033 --> 00:13:22.024
Yeah, just take it easy!

00:13:23.503 --> 00:13:28.241
No one's ever beaten
me at that game.

00:13:28.241 --> 00:13:30.677
Really?
You've played before, too?

00:13:30.677 --> 00:13:32.178
Of course!

00:13:32.178 --> 00:13:36.149
In kindergarten I
never lost a game.

00:13:36.149 --> 00:13:40.520
They called me
Greta the Great!

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:42.750
No one asked you that.

00:13:42.989 --> 00:13:47.824
I'm sure no one could
beat me even now.

00:13:50.163 --> 00:13:52.098
Greta sure is energetic.

00:13:52.098 --> 00:13:55.465
If only she could share some
of her energy with you, Saga.

00:13:55.902 --> 00:13:58.838
Don't worry.
I won't lose to a little cold.

00:13:58.838 --> 00:13:59.973
-You won't lose?

00:13:59.973 --> 00:14:01.040
-You won't lose?
-What?

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:05.170
Miss Saga. That was a
challenge to me, wasn't it?

00:14:05.278 --> 00:14:06.279
What?

00:14:06.279 --> 00:14:09.415
All right.
I'll accept your challenge.

00:14:09.415 --> 00:14:14.819
I'll show you how fearsome
Greta the Great is!

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:18.357
What?

00:14:21.794 --> 00:14:23.396
Today's game is...

00:14:23.396 --> 00:14:25.091
Ping-pong ball blowing!

00:14:26.099 --> 00:14:28.090
-Ping-pong ball blowing?
-Ping-pong ball blowing?
-Ping-pong ball blowing?

00:14:28.501 --> 00:14:29.991
What is that?

00:14:31.871 --> 00:14:34.407
Haven't you ever played it?

00:14:34.407 --> 00:14:37.399
Don't you remember?
It was popular in kindergarten.

00:14:38.378 --> 00:14:39.912
Now that you mention it!

00:14:39.912 --> 00:14:42.515
Yeah, yeah.
I've played it, too.

00:14:42.515 --> 00:14:46.007
But isn't that a
game for little kids?

00:14:47.053 --> 00:14:49.856
No matter what the game,
a challenge is a challenge!

00:14:49.856 --> 00:14:52.058
I won't lose!

00:14:52.058 --> 00:14:54.925
Now, Miss Saga, I'll leave
the preparations to you!

00:14:55.828 --> 00:14:57.463
I guess I have no choice.

00:14:57.463 --> 00:14:58.464
Saga.

00:14:58.464 --> 00:15:01.868
You're not feeling well today.
Maybe you should pass.

00:15:01.868 --> 00:15:04.268
I'm fine.
This is nothing.

00:15:06.906 --> 00:15:08.474
Are you ready?

00:15:08.474 --> 00:15:10.465
Of course I'm ready.

00:15:10.676 --> 00:15:12.278
Ok. Then here we go!

00:15:12.278 --> 00:15:14.940
Three! Two! One!

00:15:15.515 --> 00:15:16.004
Go!

00:15:16.249 --> 00:15:17.409
Here I go!

00:15:21.654 --> 00:15:22.916
Me, too!

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:36.135
-They look kind of stupid.

00:15:36.135 --> 00:15:37.261
-They look kind of stupid.
-Just a little, yeah.

00:15:38.738 --> 00:15:39.739
Ok!

00:15:39.739 --> 00:15:41.502
This is nothing!

00:15:43.409 --> 00:15:44.603
Here it comes.

00:15:46.345 --> 00:15:47.334
-Saga?
-Saga?

00:15:49.816 --> 00:15:51.517
Are you all right, Saga?

00:15:51.517 --> 00:15:52.506
Sugar.

00:15:56.889 --> 00:15:58.914
Greta wins this game!

00:16:01.461 --> 00:16:05.454
Huh? I won? Me?

00:16:08.367 --> 00:16:12.428
Of course, with my talent,
it's a given that I would win!

00:16:14.207 --> 00:16:15.241
-Saga.

00:16:15.241 --> 00:16:16.299
-Saga.
-Are you ok?

00:16:17.143 --> 00:16:19.407
I think I overdid it a bit.

00:16:19.946 --> 00:16:20.935
Oh! Saga?

00:16:22.081 --> 00:16:24.417
-Saga! Saga!
-Saga! Saga! Hang in there.

00:16:24.417 --> 00:16:26.476
I'll get a teacher!

00:16:34.494 --> 00:16:35.961
It's high.

00:16:36.863 --> 00:16:39.058
You'd better
stay in bed today!

00:16:39.098 --> 00:16:39.792
Ok.

00:16:40.366 --> 00:16:41.467
-Saga.

00:16:41.467 --> 00:16:42.832
-Saga.
-What is it, Grandma?

00:16:45.037 --> 00:16:47.507
Are you worried
about something?

00:16:47.507 --> 00:16:48.496
Why?

00:16:49.041 --> 00:16:53.444
You've been acting strangely ever
since you came home yesterday.

00:16:54.814 --> 00:16:57.016
If it's something you
can talk to me about...

00:16:57.016 --> 00:16:58.005
I'm fine.

00:16:58.451 --> 00:17:01.354
Are you sure?
If you say so, Saga.

00:17:01.354 --> 00:17:04.721
I'll make you
something good to eat.

00:17:04.924 --> 00:17:05.913
Ok.

00:17:10.463 --> 00:17:12.231
Am I all right?

00:17:12.231 --> 00:17:14.400
I can't believe
this happened.

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:16.994
Maybe I'm not all right.

00:17:25.478 --> 00:17:31.484
Typhoon 13 is still hovering, blasting the
Schwargen region with wind and rain,

00:17:31.484 --> 00:17:34.476
causing complete chaos
to transportations...

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:40.259
Sugar? Is that you, Sugar?

00:17:40.259 --> 00:17:42.489
Sugar, where are you?

00:17:43.663 --> 00:17:44.652
Sugar!

00:17:45.498 --> 00:17:46.692
Sugar!

00:17:47.533 --> 00:17:50.002
Saga? Saga!

00:17:50.002 --> 00:17:51.867
Sugar!
That's dangerous!

00:17:52.438 --> 00:17:55.441
I can.
I can return to Saga!

00:17:55.441 --> 00:18:00.071
Don't risk it! Just wait until the
typhoon's over and then come home!

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:04.438
But you're lonely, Saga.

00:18:05.451 --> 00:18:06.440
Sugar.

00:18:07.453 --> 00:18:09.444
Just wait. I won't
be much longer!

00:18:13.759 --> 00:18:14.594
Sugar!

00:18:14.594 --> 00:18:18.264
Sorry, Saga.
I can't get back...

00:18:18.264 --> 00:18:20.255
Sugar! Sugar!

00:18:23.469 --> 00:18:25.460
Another dream.

00:18:33.112 --> 00:18:35.979
Oh, now I can't
get back to sleep.

00:19:14.453 --> 00:19:15.442
Morning.

00:19:32.238 --> 00:19:34.229
Is it another dream?

00:19:37.643 --> 00:19:40.009
Oh! Is it really you, Sugar?

00:19:42.481 --> 00:19:45.143
Your fever seemed high.

00:19:45.751 --> 00:19:47.810
Did the snow feel good?

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:50.916
Yeah. But when
did you get back?

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:54.416
Saga! You've got
to get your sleep!

00:19:55.494 --> 00:19:56.495
Sugar.

00:19:56.495 --> 00:19:59.432
I'm sorry. I had to wait
for the Typhoon Fairy

00:19:59.432 --> 00:20:01.957
to finish his job, so I
was late getting back.

00:20:03.502 --> 00:20:04.491
Uh-uh.

00:20:05.338 --> 00:20:07.440
But I was so surprised.

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:10.238
When I came home,
I found you sick, Saga.

00:20:10.676 --> 00:20:11.472
Hey.

00:20:12.244 --> 00:20:13.233
What?

00:20:14.313 --> 00:20:15.514
Are you ok?

00:20:15.514 --> 00:20:16.515
I...

00:20:16.515 --> 00:20:18.483
Saga, I'm coming in.

00:20:18.984 --> 00:20:22.521
Saga! Are you sure
you should be up?

00:20:22.521 --> 00:20:23.510
Good morning.

00:20:25.091 --> 00:20:26.285
Let me see.

00:20:27.526 --> 00:20:29.895
Your fever still
hasn't gone down.

00:20:29.895 --> 00:20:30.896
Saga.

00:20:30.896 --> 00:20:32.727
I'm all right now!

00:20:32.998 --> 00:20:33.987
Saga!

00:20:34.533 --> 00:20:37.403
Somehow you really
do seem better.

00:20:37.403 --> 00:20:38.537
I am.

00:20:38.537 --> 00:20:41.540
All right. Then you drink some
of Grandma's special soup,

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:44.100
and you'll feel even better.

00:20:44.643 --> 00:20:45.473
Ok.

00:20:46.245 --> 00:20:49.548
Oh, telephone. You'd better
eat it before it gets cold.

00:20:49.548 --> 00:20:50.480
I will.

00:20:53.786 --> 00:20:56.489
Ok. I'll eat this
and feel better!

00:20:56.489 --> 00:20:57.478
No!

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:02.249
You're sick, Saga.
You've got to stay still!

00:21:04.997 --> 00:21:07.500
Here. I'll feed you!

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:10.302
Huh? That's not necessary.

00:21:10.302 --> 00:21:12.930
Don't be shy!
Say "ah."

00:21:14.039 --> 00:21:15.028
Ah.

00:21:15.808 --> 00:21:17.143
-Is it good?

00:21:17.143 --> 00:21:18.041
-Is it good?
-Yeah.

00:21:18.511 --> 00:21:20.206
Oh, I forgot!

00:21:20.513 --> 00:21:21.502
What?

00:21:23.182 --> 00:21:24.513
I'm home!

00:21:25.284 --> 00:21:26.842
Welcome back, Sugar.

00:21:29.855 --> 00:21:32.291
And now for the weather report.

00:21:32.291 --> 00:21:33.292
Over to you.

00:21:33.292 --> 00:21:34.520
Thank you.

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:37.329
Typhoon 13 has been
gradually losing strength,

00:21:37.329 --> 00:21:40.933
and through the latter half of
last night moved north-easterly,

00:21:40.933 --> 00:21:44.603
finally leaving the Schwargen region.
Watch out for flooded rivers and landslides.

00:21:44.603 --> 00:21:48.541
Finally leaving the Schwargen region.
Watch out for flooded rivers and landslides.

00:21:48.541 --> 00:21:51.310
Aside from that,
the forecast is for clear skies...
Being a Cloud Fairy is so cool!

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:54.905
Aside from that,
the forecast is for clear skies...

00:21:57.983 --> 00:21:59.848
-Give it back!
-I said, no!

00:22:05.458 --> 00:22:08.120
Oh, I guess it's no use...

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:25.945
Wishes upon the Moon

00:22:25.945 --> 00:22:29.315
Melting in the water...

00:22:29.315 --> 00:22:34.553
I found a street
lined with trees.

00:22:34.553 --> 00:22:39.658
Songs of stardust...

00:22:39.658 --> 00:22:48.000
The breeze crossing over
the Bridge of Rainbows

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:53.239
You already knew...

00:22:53.239 --> 00:22:58.110
The happiness of
connecting our hearts...

00:22:58.110 --> 00:23:00.212
Sugar Snow

00:23:00.212 --> 00:23:08.320
When powdery snow
whirls in town,

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:13.459
The season of flower
blossoms is near,

00:23:13.459 --> 00:23:17.759
And I think of you.

00:23:20.132 --> 00:23:24.703
The love that melts
our hearts and

00:23:24.703 --> 00:23:33.509
The dreams are
in your heart...

00:23:40.252 --> 00:23:43.188
Preview of Next Episode
I'm home, Saga!
Here's your souvenir.

00:23:43.188 --> 00:23:45.524
Preview of Next Episode
Thank you, Sugar.
So, what is it?

00:23:45.524 --> 00:23:49.261
It's the first snow I made. What do
you think? It's a pretty gift, isn't it?

00:23:49.261 --> 00:23:51.363
Um, it's just water now.

00:23:51.363 --> 00:23:55.901
No way. I can't believe it melted! Ok,
then I'll do a spell and make it snow again...

00:23:55.901 --> 00:23:58.737
Hey, hey. Then it
won't be a souvenir.

00:23:58.737 --> 00:24:02.675
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The Next Episode Is
"Festival! Waffo!"

00:24:02.675 --> 00:24:05.974
Oh, no, Saga!
The town's all strange!
